# Known SPA entry points -> / with 200 (serves the same index.html).
# Do not rewrite to /index.html: Cloudflare Pages Pretty URLs 308-canonicalizes
# /index.html to /, which would send every deep link (login, signup, reset
# links, /app) back to the home page.
# Keep in sync with src/utils/appRoutes.ts (SPA_REWRITE_PATHS).
# Static files (/assets/*, /legal/*, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, og.jpg,
# favicon.svg) are not listed here and are served as-is. Every other path
# falls through to 404.html (a build-time copy of index.html, see
# vite.config.js) with HTTP 404, and the SPA renders its NotFound page.
/app               /   200
/app/*             /   200
/login             /   200
/signup            /   200
/pricing           /   200
/forgot-password   /   200
/reset-password    /   200
